1
00:00:00,267 --> 00:00:01,733
Loose straw goes in.

2
00:00:01,733 --> 00:00:03,333
Hard pellets come out.

3
00:00:03,333 --> 00:00:05,933
Here is what happens in between.

4
00:00:06,133 --> 00:00:07,000
Step one.

5
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:07,800
Cleaning.

6
00:00:07,800 --> 00:00:10,667
Stones and metal are removed.

7
00:00:10,867 --> 00:00:11,600
Step two.

8
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:12,167
Drying.

9
00:00:12,167 --> 00:00:13,400
Pellets need low

10
00:00:13,400 --> 00:00:15,700
moisture to hold together.

11
00:00:16,067 --> 00:00:16,900
Step three.

12
00:00:16,900 --> 00:00:17,533
Grinding.

13
00:00:17,533 --> 00:00:18,900
A hammer mill turns

14
00:00:18,900 --> 00:00:20,800
the straw into powder.

15
00:00:21,100 --> 00:00:21,900
Step four.

16
00:00:21,900 --> 00:00:22,600
Pressing.

17
00:00:22,600 --> 00:00:24,433
Rollers force it through

18
00:00:24,433 --> 00:00:25,433
a steel die.

19
00:00:25,433 --> 00:00:28,133
Heat and pressure make it bind.

20
00:00:28,433 --> 00:00:29,933
Step five.

21
00:00:29,933 --> 00:00:31,100
Cooling.

22
00:00:31,100 --> 00:00:31,800
Hot,

23
00:00:31,800 --> 00:00:35,367
soft pellets turn hard.

24
00:00:35,733 --> 00:00:36,533
Step six.

25
00:00:36,533 --> 00:00:38,267
Screening and bagging,

26
00:00:38,267 --> 00:00:40,233
ready for the buyer.

27
00:00:40,933 --> 00:00:41,700
Six steps,

28
00:00:41,700 --> 00:00:44,067
and a waste becomes a fuel.

29
00:00:44,733 --> 00:00:45,900
Pellet makers,

30
00:00:45,900 --> 00:00:48,367
machinery suppliers and buyers.

31
00:00:48,367 --> 00:00:51,633
IndiaBiomass is bringing them together.
